  "description": "GTR Games, notorious for its \"black\" image in the industry, is introducing an unprecedented welfare system: a dating subsidy. Simply registering someone you like earns you 100,000 won, and if you connect with them, you'll receive a whopping 10 million won in bonus money!? For Seong-Eun, who considered dating a luxury and was consumed by work, this system was nothing more than a joke. However, after work, while chatting with her childhood friend and coworker, Cha Woo-Yeon, she overhears an unexpected confession.\n\n *\"I just used you roughly. I don't have anyone special to use...\"*\n\nShe initially dismisses it as sympathy, but on a whim, she checks to find 300,000 won in support money in her account. Three people in the company have expressed their feelings for Seong-Eun—!?\n\nAn office romance survival story where work, friendship, and unexpected excitement intertwine ♥ \"Whose true feelings are yours?\"\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
